{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dare to travel back 40,000 years and help the caveman escape extinction in this challenging platforming adventure across three unique worlds!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Prepare for a tough challenge in the prehistoric era! Test your skills by jumping your way up to the top, where a frozen cavewoman awaits your rescue.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579360/extras/original-c62b18f7fba089f3a9d9e23aed831534.gif?t=1748268687\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Game Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 <strong>Action-packed platforming adventure!</strong><br>\u2022 <strong>12 full levels</strong> filled with challenges!<br>\u2022 <strong>3 unique worlds</strong> with beautifully crafted environments!<br>\u2022 <strong>Help the caveman survive extinction!</strong><br>\u2022 <strong>Custom artwork and a distinctive design!</strong><br>\u2022 <strong>Reach the top \u2014 if you're skilled enough!</strong> <br>\u2022 <strong>Time your jumps carefully\u2026 or fall into the void!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579360/extras/original-b98e1dfd66b76e2f5c9b229b120b360c.gif?t=1748268687\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3579360?t=1748268687","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579360/674ebd141f99b6ff1e7e012588d156cb8daad6fc/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1748268687","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579360/1814b5d4a936444b61c701a04ec32ebc23207c98/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748268687","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared